# AI-Agent - Ho so ky thuat tai tao du an Adivisor

Tai lieu nay duoc viet de mot AI agent khac co the hieu va code lai du an Adivisor voi do trung thanh cao nhat. Du an la he thong web quan ly va phan cong Co van hoc tap (CVHT) cho lop sinh vien, gom 3 ung dung chay chung mot database MySQL:

- `Frontend`: React 18 + Vite, giao dien theo vai tro.
- `Backend`: Node.js + Express, xu ly nghiep vu chinh.
- `BackendSpringBoot`: Spring Boot 4 + Java 21, xu ly auth/JWT/OTP/Google OAuth cho frontend hien tai.
- `docker-compose.yml`: khoi chay MySQL, Redis, Node backend, Spring Boot backend, frontend va phpMyAdmin.

Luu y quan trong:

- Source hien tai co nhieu chuoi tieng Viet trong code. Neu terminal hien thi mojibake, khong duoc tu y doi literal trang thai; phai copy dung chuoi trong source hoac luu UTF-8 dung.
- Frontend hien tai route moi request `/auth/*` sang Spring Boot (`VITE_SPRING_BOOT_API_URL`) va cac request nghiep vu sang Node (`VITE_API_URL`).
- Node backend van co module auth rieng tuong duong, nhung frontend dang uu tien Spring Boot cho auth.
- Khong dua gia tri bi mat that trong `.env` vao code hay tai lieu public. Can dung placeholder cho SMTP/JWT/OAuth.
- Worktree luc doc co 2 file bi xoa san la `AGENTS.md` va `AI-CONTEXT.md`; khong lien quan den tai tao chuc nang.

