## 3. Docker Compose

`docker-compose.yml` dinh nghia:

- `mysql`: image `mysql:8.0`, container `adivisor-mysql`, command `--lower_case_table_names=1`, healthcheck bang `mysqladmin ping`, volume `mysql_data`, port `${DB_PORT:-3306}:3306`.
- `backend`: build `./Backend`, depends_on mysql healthy, env DB host `mysql`, port `${PORT:-5000}:5000`, mount source va `/app/node_modules`, command `sh -c "npm run db:init && npm run dev"`.
- `backend-springboot`: build `./BackendSpringBoot`, depends_on mysql va redis, `env_file: .env`, DB host `mysql`, Redis host `redis`, port `8080:8080`.
- `redis`: image `redis:7-alpine`, port `6379:6379`.
- `frontend`: build `./Frontend`, depends_on backend va backend-springboot, env `VITE_API_URL`, `VITE_SPRING_BOOT_API_URL`, port `5173:5173`, command `npm run dev`.
- `phpmyadmin`: image `phpmyadmin:5.2`, connects mysql root, port `${PHPMYADMIN_PORT:-8081}:80`.

Chay tat ca:

```bash
docker compose up -d --build
```

Reset database:

```bash
docker compose down -v
docker compose up -d --build
```

