- Empty class sync: class with no `SINH_VIEN` -> `ma_co_van=NULL`, `trang_thai_lop=LOP_TRONG`.
- A closed/advised class is `ma_co_van` truthy and `trang_thai_lop` in `Đã đóng`, `Đã có cố vấn`, legacy `Đã có CVHT`.
- Advisor capacity: max 2 classes in `LOP` excluding current class when approving final assignment/replacement.

Student behavior:

- `listStudents`: join student account and class.
- `createStudent`: require ma_sinh_vien, ho_va_ten, email, so_dien_thoai, ma_lop; create `TAI_KHOAN` role `sinhvien`; insert `SINH_VIEN`; increment `LOP.so_luong_sv`; if class was `Lớp trống` set to `Chưa có cố vấn`.
- `importStudents`: parse CSV rows and call `createStudent`.
- `updateStudent`: update profile, email, optional ma_lop; if class changed, decrement old class, increment new class, sync empty classes.
- `deleteStudent`: delete `SINH_VIEN`, delete `TAI_KHOAN`, decrement class, sync empty.
- `updateStudentAccountStatus`: toggle `TAI_KHOAN.is_active`.

Class behavior:

- `listClasses`: join KHOA, active truong khoa name, active advisor name only if advisor account active, and actual student count.
- `listClassGroups`: per khoa count lop, active truong khoa, group_concat class statuses; returns id, so_lop number, fallback status.
- `createClass`: require ma_lop, ma_khoa, ten_lop, chuyen_nganh; default nam_hoc current; initial `so_luong_sv` payload or 0; `ma_co_van=NULL`; status `Lớp trống`.
- `importClasses`: CSV ma_lop, ten_lop, ma_khoa, chuyen_nganh; nam_hoc current.
- `updateClass`: only if no students; update nullable fields.
- `deleteClass`: only if no students.
- `deleteStudentsByClass`: delete all students and accounts in class, set count 0, sync empty.

Assignment behavior:

- `listAssignments`: all `PHAN_CONG` not referenced by `YEU_CAU_THAY_THE`, joined class/khoa/advisor/truong khoa.
- `createAssignmentRequest`: single class must have students; create `PHAN_CONG` status `Chờ phân công`, update `LOP` status same and advisor null.
- `sendAssignmentToFaculty`: mostly validates status/students; leaves status as `Chờ phân công`.
- `sendClassRequestsToFaculties`: for every non-empty class with `ma_co_van IS NULL` and class status in `Chưa có cố vấn` or `Chờ phân công`, create new `PHAN_CONG` only if no active request in statuses `Chờ phân công`, `Đã phân công`, `Chờ giám đốc duyệt`; update class status; return sent count; if none -> badRequest.
- `resetClassAdvisors`: only when every non-empty class is closed/advised and no active/rejected assignments; deletes active/rejected assignment rows for non-empty classes, sets non-empty classes `ma_co_van=NULL`, status `Chờ phân công`.
- `approveAssignment`: final CTSV/Giam doc approval; valid transition to `Đã đóng`; require selected active advisor, capacity <2; update LOP advisor/status, update PHAN_CONG status/year/date; notify `lop`, `khoa`, `covan`.
- `rejectAssignment`: only from `Chờ giám đốc duyệt`; set assignment back `Chờ phân công`, null advisor, update class status; notify khoa.
- Bulk approve/reject: operate on all director-waiting assignments excluding replacement assignments; bulk approve combines recipients into one notification.

Replacement behavior:

- `listReplacementRequests`: all requests joined PHAN_CONG, LOP, KHOA, old advisor, new advisor if active, truong khoa.
- `approveReplacement`: final approval; valid transition to `Giám đốc đã duyệt`; require new active advisor and capacity; update LOP to new advisor and `Đã đóng`, update PHAN_CONG `Đã đóng`, update request `Đã đóng`; notify lop, khoa, old advisor, new advisor.
- `rejectReplacement`: transition to `Bị từ chối`; notify khoa and old advisor.
- Bulk approve/reject: statuses `Khoa đã duyệt` or `Giám đốc đang duyệt`.

Notification creation:

- CTSV notification uses actual `user.ma_nhan_vien`.
- Deduplicate recipients by `loai_nguoi_nhan:ma_doi_tuong`.

